### Turn-key Logistics and Sourcing with Tez Motors
Tez Motors offers a transparent, turn-key delivery process for the Li Auto Li L6. We handle model selection, purchasing from verified Chinese suppliers, shipping insurance, transport via professional car carriers within 15-25 days, customs clearance, recycling fees, and official license plate registration. The customer receives a fully registered car with a locked contract price. Each shipment is tracked via GPS, allowing real-time shipping updates.

### Warranty and Technical Support
For our customers' peace of mind, Tez Motors provides an official technical warranty of up to 3 years covering the motor, battery, and transmission. Servicing is conducted through our authorized service partners in Tashkent and other major cities, fully equipped with specialized diagnostic tools and genuine spare parts. Our mechanics have undergone specialized training directly from EV manufacturers.

