Tez Motors offers an official warranty on all supplied chargers and accessories. Our technicians are ready to diagnose, configure, or repair equipment to ensure reliable performance. We maintain a local parts supply to guarantee quick service turnarounds. All technical support queries are handled with high priority, and our engineers are ready to assist you on-site whenever required.

