Tez Motors assists customers at every stage. We supply certified charging accessories, help coordinate home charging station installations, and provide technical guidance for a shopping/ownership experience. We strive to provide a complete ecosystem for electric car owners. We don't just sell charging units; we provide full installation support and regular maintenance services to ensure continuous operation.

### Warranty Support for Accessories
Tez Motors offers an official warranty on all supplied chargers and accessories. Our technicians are ready to diagnose, configure, or repair equipment to ensure reliable performance. We maintain a local parts supply to guarantee quick service turnarounds. All technical support queries are handled with high priority, and our engineers are ready to assist you on-site whenever required.

